orybook/milestone/37","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/milestones/37/labels","id":5713599,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNTcxMzU5OQ==","number":37,"title":"6.0.x","description":"Bugs in 6.0 that we should fix in a patch release","creator":{"login":"shilman","id":488689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODY4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/488689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman","html_url":"https://github.com/shilman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":97,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:57:00Z","updated_at":"2021-07-14T04:17:36Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2020-11-02T00:48:57Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2020-08-19T18:35:30Z","updated_at":"2020-08-20T08:19:57Z","closed_at":"2020-08-20T08:19:56Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWhen organizing my stories and docs using the [\"CSF Stories with MDX Docs\" recipe](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/next/addons/docs/docs/recipes.md#csf-stories-with-mdx-docs), the displayed story name is appended with `\" Story\"` and the path is appended with `\"-story\"`, unless I define an explicit `name` for the story. The displayed name is a bit annoying, but the path breaks existing story permalinks.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n_See code snippets_\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nI would expect the displayed story name and path to be unaffected, regardless of story organization method.\r\n\r\n**Code snippets**\r\n\r\n```jsx\r\n// Component.stories.jsx\r\n\r\nimport { Component } from '..';\r\n\r\nexport const Example1 = () => <Component />;\r\n\r\nexport const Example2 = () => <Component />;\r\nExample2.storyName = 'Example2';\r\n\r\nexport const Example3 = () => <Component />;\r\n```\r\n\r\n```jsx\r\n// Component.stories.mdx\r\n\r\nimport { Component } from '..';\r\nimport * as stories from './Component.stories';\r\n\r\n<Meta title=\"Component\" component={Component} />\r\n\r\n<Story story={stories.Example1} />\r\n\r\n<Story story={stories.Example2} />\r\n\r\n<Story story={stories.Example3} name=\"Example3\" />\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe three stories in the snippets above display as:\r\n\r\n1. \"Example1 Story\" (/?path=/story/component--example-1-story)\r\n    - Incorrect; should be: \"Example1\" (/?path=/story/component--example-1)\r\n1. \"Example2\" (/?path=/story/component--example-2)\r\n    - Correct\r\n1. \"Example3\" (/?path=/story/component--example-3)\r\n    - Correct\r\n\r\n**System:**\r\n\r\n- @storybook/addon-docs@6.0.12\r\n- @storybook/react@6.0.12\r\n\r\n```\r\nSystem:\r\n    OS: macOS Mojave 10.14.6\r\n    CPU: (12) x64 Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8850H CPU @ 2.60GHz\r\n  Binaries:\r\n    Node: 12.16.0 - ~/.nvm/versions/node/v12.16.0/bin/node\r\n    Yarn: 1.22.4 - ~/.nvm/versions/node/v12.16.0/bin/yarn\r\n    npm: 6.13.4 - ~/.nvm/versions/node/v12.16.0/bin/npm\r\n  Browsers:\r\n    Chrome: 84.0.4147.135\r\n    Firefox: 78.0.2\r\n    Safari: 13.1.1\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"shilman","id":488689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODY4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/488689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman","html_url":"https://github.com/shilman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/12143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/12143/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}